{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108550","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108550","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1510855001:1":{"text":"조금 전 그게 <style=\"highlight\">사냥의 신의 환영</style>이었다는 거야?","source_cn":"刚才那是<style=highlight>狩猎神的幻象...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x174DF41FFDD7CE6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510855002:1":{"text":"네. 진짜 신이라면 저희가 그렇게 쉽게 이길 수 없었을 테니까요.","source_cn":"是的，真正的神明不可能轻易被我们击败。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4700951F240E22C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510855003:1":{"text":"어휴, 성가셔... 일단 바닥에 떨어진 기억의 구슬부터 줍자.","source_cn":"唉，真麻烦……先捡起地上的记忆球吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16663491CB567A69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510855004:1":{"text":"이제부터는 더 조심해야 할 거야. 사냥의 신의 환영이 어디서 또 튀어나올지 모르니까.","source_cn":"接下来的路得更小心了，说不定哪里又埋伏着一个狩猎神的幻象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20541F121F576C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"모르간","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}